</center><H1 ALIGN=CENTER> Barbarians Guild Info</H1>

<BLOCKQUOTE>
<br><hr><br>
<pre>


Name: Barbarian Guild
Command: barbarian
Creators: Digga, Quadra and Runeaxe
Maximum level: 35

Description:
The mighty barbarian guild is a loosely run group of battle hardened warriors.
 Through intense training in the wilds, members become both mentally and
physically tough.  These ferocious warriors excel at many combat skills.

Joining requirements:
 Background must be nomad (passed)
Abilities gained when joining:
 In the name of Groo wear the shrunken skull necklace with pride.
 May train skill Attack to 11%
 May train skill Bludgeons to 11%
 May train skill Consider to 11%
 May train skill Compare to 7%
 May train skill Fire building to 3%
 May train skill Camping to 3%
 May train skill Push to 11%
 May train skill Consider to 7%

